---
import { lifecycleNodes } from '../data/architecture';
---

<figure
  class="lifecycle-diagram"
  data-lifecycle-diagram
  aria-labelledby="lifecycle-diagram-title"
  aria-describedby="lifecycle-diagram-desc"
>
  <span id="lifecycle-diagram-title" class="visually-hidden">
    请求生命周期示意
  </span>
  <p id="lifecycle-diagram-desc" class="visually-hidden">
    六个节点：任务进入 → 编排决策 → 模型选择 → 工具 / 知识调用 → HITL
    gate；工具调用、数据变更与人工审批留下 audit
    标记；输出与评测的评测结果经虚线回路回到编排与知识迭代。
  </p>

  <div class="timeline">
    <ol class="node-grid" aria-label="请求生命周期六个节点">
      {lifecycleNodes.map((node, index) => (
        <li class="node" data-lifecycle-node={node.id}>
          <div class="node-head">
            <span class="node-no">{node.no}</span>
            <span class="node-label">{node.label}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="node-name">{node.name}</p>
          <p class="node-desc">{node.description}</p>
          <div class="node-marks">
            {node.permission && <span class="badge badge-permission">权限检查点</span>}
            {node.hitl && <span class="badge badge-hitl">HITL</span>}
            {node.audits?.map((audit) => (
              <span class="badge badge-audit" data-audit-mark>
                <i class="audit-tick" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                AUDIT · {audit}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
          {index < lifecycleNodes.length - 1 && (
            <span class="node-link" data-lifecycle-link aria-hidden="true">
              <i></i>
            </span>
          )}
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <div class="trace-band" data-trace-span aria-label="一条 trace 贯穿全部节点，用于排障与回放。">
      <span class="trace-label">TRACE</span>
      <span class="trace-rail" aria-hidden="true">
        {lifecycleNodes.map(() => (
          <i class="trace-dot" data-trace-dot></i>
        ))}
      </span>
      <span class="trace-copy">一条 trace 贯穿全部节点，用于排障与回放。</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="loop" data-iteration-loop>
    <span class="loop-rail" data-loop-rail aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="loop-copy">
      <b>评测结果 → 编排 / 知识迭代</b>
      <span>迭代不等于自动改生产。</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .lifecycle-diagram {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .visually-hidden {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
    clip-path: inset(50%);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  .node-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .node {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 18px 16px 16px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    background: var(--color-canvas);
  }

  .node-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .node-no {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-red-dark);
  }

  .node-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .node-name {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .node-desc {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .node-marks {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 14px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 20px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .badge-permission {
    border-color: var(--color-line-strong);
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .badge-hitl {
    border-color: rgb(245 48 3 / 35%);
    background: var(--color-red-wash);
    color: var(--color-red-dark);
  }

  .badge-audit {
    background: var(--color-canvas);
  }

  .audit-tick {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    margin-right: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-2);
    border-radius: 1px;
  }

  .node-link {
    position: absolute;
    top: 30px;
    right: -6px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: var(--color-canvas);
  }

  .node-link i {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-red-dark);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-red-dark);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .trace-band {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-site-sm);
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .trace-label {
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-red-dark);
  }

  .trace-rail {
    display: grid;
    flex: 1;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .trace-rail i {
    position: relative;
    height: 1px;
    border-top: 1px dotted var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .trace-rail i::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    left: 50%;
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .trace-copy {
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .loop {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-left: calc(100% / 6);
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .loop::before,
  .loop::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-left: 1px dashed var(--color-red-dark);
  }

  .loop::before {
    right: 0;
  }

  .loop::after {
    left: 0;
  }

  .loop-rail {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-red-dark);
  }

  .loop-rail::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -4px;
    left: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-red-dark);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-red-dark);
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .loop-copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 4px 14px;
    margin-top: 11px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-site-sm);
    background: var(--color-canvas);
  }

  .loop-copy b {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }

  .loop-copy span {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .node-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .node-link {
      display: none;
    }

    .trace-rail {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .trace-copy {
      display: none;
    }

    .loop {
      margin-left: 0;
    }

    .loop::before,
    .loop::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .node-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .node {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .trace-band {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .trace-rail {
      width: 100%;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .loop {
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .loop-copy {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .trace-rail {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
